    "What is the objective of this plan — are you minimizing total cost, maximizing total tables, or something else",
    "if minimizing cost, is the 150-table minimum a hard requirement you must meet"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for the primary objective (cost vs. tables) and separately asks for a specific constraint condition (hardness of the 150-table minimum) that applies only if the objective is cost minimization. These are semantically distinct requests."
}

