    "Is the 600-table maximum a hard upper bound on the total number of tables ordered, or is it just a loose cap that the cost-minimizing solution would naturally stay under?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response contains a single clarification question asking for the nature of the 600-table constraint (hard bound vs. loose cap)."
}

