  "atomic_questions": [
    "Are there any per-supplier limits on how many orders you can place with each supplier (e.g., a maximum number of orders or a maximum number of tables from A, B, or C individually), or can you order any integer number of orders from each?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding per-supplier order limits, presenting a binary choice between having limits or having no limits."
}

